sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client(public/client.js)
  participant R as routes.js
  participant RM as rooms.js
  participant DB as db/index.js
  participant W as World(engine.js)
  participant GO as go.js
  participant AI as ai.js

  Note over C,GO: === 形状配置透传链（建房 → 判决 → 快照）===
  C->>R: POST /api/rooms {mode, board:{w,h,shape}}
  R->>RM: createRoom({...,board})
  RM->>RM: normBoard(board, mode) → room.board
  RM->>DB: roomsRepo.create(..., JSON.stringify(board))  (board TEXT)
  RM-->>R: room{board}
  R-->>C: {room: roomInfo(room)}  (含 board)

  C->>R: POST /api/rooms/:code/world
  R->>W: new World(id,owner,seed,{mode,...,board})
  W->>W: normBoard 双保险 → this.board ; _bmp = decodeBoard
  R-->>C: {worldId, room}

  Note over W: rts: _genResources / _seedOnboarding 按 _isWall 重裁
  Note over C,GO: === go 形状化落子 + AI 适配 ===
  W->>AI: goAIMove(world, f)
  AI->>AI: 候选 + 空盘 OFFS 过滤 _isPlayable（Q6=a）
  AI-->>W: {moves:[...]} 或 {pass}
  C->>W: applyGoIntent({moves})
  W->>GO: _goPlayBatch（形状外∪虚空 → 'oob'）
  GO->>GO: _goLiberties（虚空不计气）/ _goTryCapture / 自杀判定
  GO->>GO: _goEvolveOnce（虚空恒 0、不计 8 邻）
  GO->>GO: _goEndTurn → _goFinish → _goEnclosedEmpty（虚空当墙阻断空区）
  GO-->>C: go_end{winner, ranked, blackScore, whiteScore}

  Note over W,GO: === rts 形状化 tick（复用原调用点，不新增定时器 IR-3b）===
  W->>W: _lifeStep / _captureEnclosed / _updateVoronoi / _updateRegionControl（均走 _isWall）
  W->>W: _checkVictoryConditions（形状小→软提示领土线可达性）

  C->>R: GET /api/worlds/:id 或 WS hello
  R->>W: snapshot()
  W-->>C: settings{...,board} + boardMap(低频) + lifeW

  Note over R,DB: === 房主中途改形状（含已开局门禁 Q3=a）===
  participant H as Host(房主)
  H->>R: PATCH /api/rooms/:code/settings {board}
  R->>RM: getRoom(code)
  R->>R: hostId !== req.user.id ? 403 not_host
  R->>R: w.started && board 传入 ? 403 board_locked（服务端强制）
  R->>RM: normBoard(board, mode)
  RM->>DB: roomsRepo.setSettings(code, {board})
  RM->>W: w.board = normalized ; w._bmp = decodeBoard
  R-->>H: {code:0, board, room: roomInfo(room)}
